    "body": "> Interesting, when testing (in Chrome and Firefox) this I do not observe the fragment change on document.open. Do you know if there are existing WPT tests for this feature? I think if the URL can actually change here we would want to notify the client.\r\n\r\nIt is conditional on \"If entryDocument is not document\" but I am not quite sure yet when this is the case.",
